{
  "additional_concerns": [
    "The source states both “will take immediate effect” and “will take effect on 28 November 2025 (Effective Date).” They may coincide or concern different implementation details; the supplied text does not resolve this.",
    "The formula fixes legacy pending status at commencement and makes it a relief exclusion. Preservation of the existing application process supports transitional treatment, but does not expressly establish an indefinite exclusion after approval, withdrawal or replacement.",
    "The legally relevant event represented by assessment_date remains unresolved. A date comparison cannot settle that interpretation.",
    "The missing dependency IDs have no identifying metadata. Neither can safely be assigned to the FAQs, forms, checklists or existing approval process.",
    "Home-jurisdiction compliance and the feature and policy classifications are supplied judgments, not determinations implemented by this formula. Applicable home-jurisdiction requirements and any relevant interpretive guidance remain necessary for concrete assessments.",
    "Missing FAQ content prevents a completeness conclusion; it does not itself demonstrate an omitted executable condition.",
    "FALSE means only that the proposed relief test is not satisfied. It establishes neither an approval duty nor non-compliance. TRUE does not discharge notification, filing or post-vetting obligations."
  ],
